WEBVTT

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.170
Could you take me to
Saikawa Cemetery?

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:34.700
Sure.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.010
You going home alone this late,
Miss? A cram school or something?

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.070
You should be careful
around the cemetery.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.410
I heard they appear.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.210
What appears?

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.950
Ghosts! I've never seen any
but my pals do all the time.

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.690
I'm not particularly scared.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:59.800
I see, so is that how
girls are nowadays?

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.800
How about here?

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.410
She... she was a ghost!!!

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.430
I wonder if it was too much?

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.760
Are you excited by
your long awaited hunt?

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.510
I might have been
drunk from the blood.

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:50.310
Well, he's got a good story to tell.
Like, "I saw a ghost girl!"

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:54.020
That's true.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:45.660
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.700
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:55.750
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:03.410
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.680
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:14.260
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:19.530
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:24.160
No one knows her true face.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:53.900
Morning.

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:00.410
Morning.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.510
Morning.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:05.880
Hey, Miyu, have you heard? They say
a ghost appeared at Saikawa Cemetery.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.080
Really?

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.580
Do you think it's funny?

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.010
No. Sorry. But it's
a rumor, isn't it?

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:16.180
Well, the one who saw it
is one of my uncle's friends.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:17.590
Is that so?

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:22.990
Yup, he's a taxi driver. That late night,
he drove a girl to Saikawa Cemetery.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.230
But when he got there,
the girl had disappeared.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.440
And there was blood on the seat.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:29.940
Blood?

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:34.440
But facts become exaggerated
when passed from friend to friend.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:35.840
Don't you believe me?

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:39.180
It's not that, just,
is there any proof?

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.920
Well, my uncle didn't
see blood, though.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.820
The guy said it was so gross
that he washed it off soon.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.850
But he doesn't seem
the type of person to lie.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.350
Miyu, what do you think?

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:56.160
If there really was blood,
I don't think it could be a ghost.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:01.230
That's true. And supposedly,
the girl was in a uniform of this school...

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:04.440
and tied her hair just like Miyu's.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.630
He said he remembered well
'cause of the unusual hairstyle.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:08.470
Hey, cut it out!

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.640
Huh? Oh, that's not what I meant.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.610
No, I don't care.

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.150
Chisato.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:19.120
What?

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.450
What if I...

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.650
Huh?

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.150
Nothing. Never mind.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:27.320
Are you worried about what Yukari
said? You know it can't be true.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.830
Even if it was a ghost.
It has nothing to do with you.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:31.890
Thanks.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:33.800
Look, you remember...

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:37.170
What the vender said
when we bought them?

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.300
"This'll protect your friendship."

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:40.800
Yes, just like he said.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:46.180
Whenever I look at it, I always think
of that we'll be friends forever.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:50.140
So that's why I
believe in you, Miyu.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.350
Thank you.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.540
We're here, Miss.

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.540
Something wrong?

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:21.340
I'm afraid I've dropped a contact lens.
I'm sorry but would you help me find it?

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.040
That's a problem.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.120
I hope you haven't stepped on it.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:28.780
Yes.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:03.550
There's something going
on without my knowledge.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:07.090
Some humans must
be messing around.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:10.260
Probably so. If there was
a Shinma nearby...

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.360
I would have known by now.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.970
Nevertheless, you should
hold off on hunting for a while.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.660
There's no need to invite trouble.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:22.070
It would be a nuisance
if it was mistaken for me.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.250
But, it's exasperating.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:29.110
While the night belongs to us,
the humans just defile it more and more.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.080
Well, that's the trend these days.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:35.390
Reiha?

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:40.620
Nice to see you again.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.960
What a fine house you have.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:46.490
What do you want?

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:50.240
Oh, that's right. I happened
to see something.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:51.700
See what?

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:56.610
We saw you sucking
the taxi driver's blood.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.150
Were you that hungry, Miyu?

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:03.580
Sucking away like some animal.
Not at all like a Guardian should be.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:08.650
It wasn't me! Do you think I'd
hunt so carelessly as to be seen?!

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:12.220
Still yet, I'm sure it was you.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.330
Moreover, she came into this cemetery.
There could be no mistake.

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:20.360
Came here?

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.830
Anyway, we'll keep an eye on you.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:26.810
It would be a problem if you were
seen and got us all into trouble.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:32.240
None of us was born yesterday.
We should have our dignity.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:36.180
No matter what I say, you won't trust me.
So do what you want.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.110
Yes. I will do as I please.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.370
They say another driver
got his blood sucked.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.970
Is that a rumor, too?

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:00.870
Kind of.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.410
But it's true that he was injured
on the neck and hospitalized.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.880
Even for me,
it's hard to believe that part.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.540
Actually getting your blood sucked,
you know.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.750
But they say the girl was wearing
a Tokiwa school uniform.

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:16.620
That's the thing.
Why is that?

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.780
Listen! How about this?

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.490
Say someone has a grudge
against our school...

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:24.000
and is causing these incidents,
while wearing our uniform.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.770
Well, that sounds more
realistic than ghosts.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.400
That's gotta be it.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:29.200
Uh, oh!

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.660
What's wrong?

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.970
I forgot my bag.
Go ahead.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.740
It's got to be a rumor.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.410
But it might be real.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.740
Someone is... tricking us.

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.920
I thought we'd go home together.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:53.920
I was gonna catch up.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.590
Miyu?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.900
That's Chisato!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:14.820
No!!!!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.750
Chisato! What the?

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:47.840
Chisato!

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.820
Chisato, are you okay?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.080
Chisato!!!

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.590
But, what was that?

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.330
I wonder if it was a doppelganger.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:06.460
What's that?

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.170
It's a supernatural phenomenon
that creates a duplicate of you.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.310
But they say, if you see it...

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.740
You'll die, right?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.440
I'm sorry, but...

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:20.520
That's all right.
I don't believe in it.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.350
Miyu...

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.350
Is it really you?

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:30.620
Don't worry.
This is the real Miyu.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.490
I'm glad.
Would you stay here?

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.320
Chisato, I'm sorry.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:39.700
No, it's not your fault.
I know it wasn't you.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:40.830
See.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.870
She ran away when she saw it.
Then I knew it wasn't you.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:48.070
Things have gotten weird.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:54.570
I don't think it's some supernatural
phenomenon. I think a human did this.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.350
Miyu, do you know of anyone
holding a grudge against you?

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.650
No, I don't.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:11:59.620
But...

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.820
It's unforgivable.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:11.070
It dared to attack Chisato.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.290
Even though she's your prey?

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:16.800
Don't you have any tact at all?

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:21.440
Matsukaze, I don't think you
should upset Miyu right now.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.010
Okay, we'll find out
sooner or later.

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:27.380
Yes... Yes that's right.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.600
Chisato.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.790
Chisato.

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.860
Chisato, you have a phone call.

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.040
Okay!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.380
Why can't they just give me
a phone in my room?

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:08.590
Oh, Miyu? What's up
at this time of night?

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:11.750
Sure, I can, but are you
in that much of a hurry?

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.790
Got it. I'll be right there.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.690
Oh, Miyu!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.730
Where are you going?

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.030
Where?

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.930
You're the one who called me.

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:58.970
Oh... right.

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:01.670
What's wrong?
You're acting funny.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:02.770
It's your imagination.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:05.680
Really? Anyway, so
what do you need?

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.210
Will you talk with me for a while?

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:08.540
You called me for that?

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.850
Chisato, move away!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.660
Thanks, Chisato.
Be careful on the way home.

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:24.060
What's going on?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:27.700
That was my shadow.
I'll take care of it.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.840
Wait! What the heck was that?

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:06.540
I finally caught you.
You won't get away again.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:13.850
Isn't it you who's been caught?

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.620
You mean to insist that
you're the real one?

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.410
Exactly.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:20.450
I am Miyu.
The Vampire Miyu.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:22.120
Who are YOU?

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:30.500
Incredible.
They are identical.

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:33.930
The other one might be
the real one as she says.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.100
How can you say
such a stupid thing?

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.830
Quiet please. Let's observe
the situation here.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.670
You played my doppelganger, right?

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:47.610
You tried to trick me into believing
that I wanted to hunt shamelessly...

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:50.750
and deep down I want to hurt Chisato.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:53.410
But you underestimate me.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:57.780
There's no other Miyu but me.
I don't believe there could be another.

00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:02.460
I am the real Miyu.
I'll make the impostor vanish.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:12.070
Return!

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:17.940
Even the flames are the same.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:21.250
Like I said.
I am Miyu.

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.050
This is confusing. Which
should we take care of first?

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.850
Oh, why, there's no need to consider.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.060
What are you going do?

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.690
Shut up shrimp!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:17:00.380
HO-JYO

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:03.150
So, you are a Shinma.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:05.760
If those silly assistants
hadn't distracted me...

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.460
I could have continued deceiving you.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:12.500
I told you. I'll never believe
there's another me.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:17.270
And I have Larva.
He would never, ever mistake me.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.930
What confidence!
Fitting for the Guardian.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:24.470
What did you want?
Did you think I would self-destruct?

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.480
I wanted to defeat you.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.510
If I became the Guardian...

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:31.610
no shinma would ever fear
the shadow of the Guardian again.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:36.890
Miyu, you are but a small vampire girl.
What right have you to seal Shinma?

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.450
I have no such right.
It is my fate.

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:42.790
I may sympathize with you,

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:43.590
but...

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.160
I won't forgive anyone who
creates havoc in my own yard.

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:47.900
You speak nonsense!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.170
Larva!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.940
Do you think
you can defeat me?

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:10.920
Larva!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.920
Shall I assist you?

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.130
Yeah, right, I don't trust you.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.830
Even a shrimp has it's use.

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:21.500
I got you!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:27.400
Damn you!

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:34.910
Stray Shinma, to the Dark!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.950
I was so close!

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:48.060
Anyhow, all seems to be
settled. Now, I'll take my leave.

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.660
One moment!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:51.960
Is there a problem?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:56.600
If I had been one second later,
You would have hit Miyu as well.

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:59.370
My, you jump to conclusions.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.140
I've known Miyu for a very long time.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:07.240
I couldn't possibly lay a
finger on an old friend.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:12.480
Even if she did and could defeat Miyu,
it means she's not fit for a Guardian.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.180
More importantly,
you are a European Shinma.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.160
There are no guarantees
you won't betray her.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:19.490
If Miyu continues as the Guardian...

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:23.430
Shouldn't she be prepared
for these kind of things?

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:29.000
Well, do take care. Farewell all.

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:34.470
How creepy! Can't we
do something about them?

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:38.200
I may have to settle
things some day.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.320
It seems I'm also under suspicion.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:46.250
Let them think what they want.
We have present matters to attend to.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.980
Chisato believes you, right?

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:51.820
Yes, but there's one more thing.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:55.360
Or no one will feel safe
walking home at night.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:00.990
Where to?

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.740
Saikawa Cemetery, please.

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.900
No, no! You can't go there!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:07.600
Why?

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.610
'Cause a ghost comes out,
a young girl...

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.680
Weren't you that?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.720
Then let me off here, please.

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:01.230
So what happened to
your doppelganger, Miyu?

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.330
I followed it and caught
up, then it vanished.

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.920
That kind of thing happens, I guess.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:09.630
They say the taxi ghost
disappeared, too. What a relief.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.740
Chisato, I'm sorry.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:13.810
What for?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:19.110
I used you to lure out my shadow...
you might have been in danger.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.410
No way, I believed in you.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:25.950
I never though you would hurt me.
Because we are friends.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:27.120
Thanks.

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:31.120
But when you ran after
that thing you looked so cool!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.660
You must be really
strong, aren't you?

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.060
Oh, that's not true.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:38.290
Next time, if something happens,
I'll be the one to save you.

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:42.440
Who was it who called me in tears
saying she saw the ghost of Miyu?

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:45.100
You said you wouldn't tell anyone!

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:13.560
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:20.340
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:26.880
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:34.620
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.390
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:43.160
I don't need friends.

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.000
That's a lie.

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:47.230
I don't even need myself.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:48.030
It's the truth.

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:56.640
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:04.110
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:04.220 --> 00:23:13.390
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:14.900 --> 00:23:21.230
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:21.570 --> 00:23:28.410
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:01.040 --> 00:25:03.940
The fate of the young siblings,
handed down from heaven...

00:25:04.270 --> 00:25:06.540
was too much for humans to bare.

00:25:07.180 --> 00:25:10.870
They don't want any special powers,
they just want a normal life.

00:25:11.410 --> 00:25:16.580
However, a shinma destroys
their innocent wish.

00:25:17.220 --> 00:25:18.980
Is this also fate?

00:25:19.860 --> 00:25:23.050
Next episode of Vampire
Princess Miyu: Fate

00:25:24.030 --> 00:25:27.390
I can't escape my fate, either.
